<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AI Maturity Assessment Results</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 10px 0 0 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #1f2937;
    }
    .intro {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #4b5563;
    }
    .score-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{maturityColor maturityLevel}} 0%, {{maturityColor maturityLevel}}dd 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .score-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .maturity-level {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .total-score {
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .score-max {
      font-size: 20px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: #f0f9ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .info-box-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1e40af;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .info-box-content {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #4b5563;
    }
    .stats-grid {
      display: table;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .stat-item {
      display: table-cell;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .stat-value {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e40af;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 6px 8px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }
    .attachment-notice {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #78350f;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #3b82f6;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background-color: #e5e7eb;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🎯 AI Maturity Assessment</h1>
      <p>Assessment Results Report</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <!-- Greeting -->
      <div class="greeting">
        Xin chào,
      </div>

      <!-- Intro -->
      <div class="intro">
        Thank you for completing the AI Maturity Assessment for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>.
        Your detailed report is now ready for review.
      </div>

      <!-- Score Card -->
      <div class="score-card">
        <div class="score-label">Maturity Level Achieved</div>
        <div class="maturity-level">{{maturityLevel}}</div>
        <div class="total-score">{{formatNumber totalScore 2}}</div>
        <div class="score-max">/ 5.0</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Info Box -->
      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="info-box-title">📊 What does this mean?</div>
        <div class="info-box-content">
          {{#if (gte totalScore 4.6)}}
            Your organization demonstrates <strong>optimal AI maturity</strong> with systematic processes,
            continuous improvement, and industry-leading practices. Continue exploring cutting-edge AI innovations.
          {{else if (gte totalScore 3.6)}}
            Your organization shows <strong>mature AI capabilities</strong> with well-defined processes.
            Focus on optimizing existing systems and exploring advanced AI applications.
          {{else if (gte totalScore 2.6)}}
            Your organization is in a <strong>development phase</strong> with growing AI capabilities.
            Prioritize standardizing processes and building organizational readiness.
          {{else if (gte totalScore 1.6)}}
            Your organization is in the <strong>early stages</strong> of AI adoption.
            Focus on building foundational capabilities and organizational awareness.
          {{else}}
            Your organization is <strong>beginning its AI journey</strong>.
            Establish basic data collection and create a roadmap for AI adoption.
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats Grid -->
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">5</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Domains</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">37</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Items</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Complete</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PDF Attachment Notice -->
      <div class="attachment-notice">
        📎 A comprehensive PDF report is attached to this email with detailed analysis,
        gap recommendations, and strategic action items.
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Button -->
      <center>
        <a href="{{resultsUrl}}" class="cta-button">
          View Full Report Online →
        </a>
      </center>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <!-- Additional Info -->
      <div class="intro">
        <strong>Assessment Completed:</strong> {{formatDate completedAt}}<br>
        <strong>Organization:</strong> {{organizationName}}
      </div>

      <!-- Next Steps -->
      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="info-box-title">🚀 Next Steps</div>
        <div class="info-box-content">
          <ol style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Review the detailed PDF report attached to this email</li>
            <li>Share results with key stakeholders and leadership</li>
            <li>Prioritize improvement areas based on business objectives</li>
            <li>Develop a detailed roadmap with timelines and metrics</li>
            <li>Schedule follow-up assessments quarterly to track progress</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Support -->
      <div class="intro" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        If you have any questions about your results or need assistance interpreting the report,
        please don't hesitate to contact our support team.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        <strong>AI Maturity Assessment Platform</strong><br>
        Helping organizations measure and improve their AI readiness
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 15px;">
        This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.<br>
        For support, visit our <a href="#">help center</a> or <a href="#">contact us</a>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 15px; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 11px;">
        © 2025 AI Maturity Assessment Platform. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
